/ALTERNATENAME:?AllocVoid@CHashElementBankQ532@@UAEPAXXZ=?AllocVoid@?$CObjectBank@VCBankElem18@@@@UAEPAXXZ
/ALTERNATENAME:?FreeVoid@CHashElementBankQ532@@UAEXPAX@Z=?FreeVoid@?$CObjectBank@VCBankElem18@@@@UAEXPAX@Z
/ALTERNATENAME:?Term@CHashElementBankQ532@@UAEXXZ=?Term@?$CObjectBank@VCBankElem18@@@@UAEXXZ
/ALTERNATENAME:?AllocVoid@CLinkNodeBank@@UAEPAXXZ=?AllocVoid@?$CObjectBank@VCBankElem0c@@@@UAEPAXXZ
/ALTERNATENAME:?FreeVoid@CLinkNodeBank@@UAEXPAX@Z=?FreeVoid@?$CObjectBank@VCBankElem0c@@@@UAEXPAX@Z
/ALTERNATENAME:?Term@CLinkNodeBank@@UAEXXZ=?Term@?$CObjectBank@VCBankElem0c@@@@UAEXXZ
/ALTERNATENAME:?AllocVoid@CThreadMsgBank@@UAEPAXXZ=?AllocVoid@?$CObjectBank@VCBankElem20@@@@UAEPAXXZ
